36
00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:30.069
James Finley: So, on the positive side, I think a house of cards is, you know, these can be beautiful and elegant structures, right? They have nice symmetry, there's something about the fact that they exist.

37
00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:36.599
James Finley: That is impressive. But, the dominant feature of a house of cards is that it's really fragile.

38
00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:54.499
James Finley: And the first time I heard this analogy used, was when someone in a seminar presented a set of results that was… and those results were based on, a lot of weak results from other studies. So, this is…

