00:11:54.520 --> 00:12:12.259
James Finley: you know, the way that we do science, of course, is that we build a foundation from existing work, and we try to extend that work in novel and interesting directions. However, our ability to do, you know, good, rigorous science depends on building from a really strong foundation.

