444
01:13:14.650 --> 01:13:25.589
James Finley: So, for example, I'm cycling in a for loop through different participants. I just use my looping variable, which normally you might call I, just call it participant.

445
01:13:25.830 --> 01:13:31.689
James Finley: That it's really easy for somebody to read your code and say, oh, this loop cycles through the participants.

